{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295060","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1029506001:2":{"text":"初めまして～あたしはフィーっていうの！あなたはこの近くに住んでる村人さん？","source_cn":"你好呀~我叫菲！你是住在这附近的村民吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB2FC718C691C50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029506002:2":{"text":"え？……あ、どうも、私はテセスよ。以前まではこの先にある村に住んでたわ……","source_cn":"啊……你、你好，我叫泰瑟丝。我以前就住在前面的村落里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8591B626E7553BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029506003:1":{"text":"色々あって……今は一時的に別の所に引っ越してるの。","source_cn":"因为一些……总之，现在搬去了别的地方暂住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B0DE13912AEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029506003":{"text":"色々あって……今は一時的に別の所に引っ越してるの。","source_cn":"因为一些……总之，现在搬去了别的地方暂住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B0DE13912AEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029506004:1":{"text":"ええ、私の主人が……だから今は両親と暮らしているの……","source_cn":"是的，孩子的父亲也……我现在只能和父母一起生活……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72659C944FCCA6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029506005:1":{"text":"この話はやめましょう。何かご用かしら？","source_cn":"不提这些了，你们有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD0F6600F092987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029506008:1":{"text":"あたしたち、宝探しをしてるの！","source_cn":"我们在寻宝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CEFE3A98EDB7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029506009:1":{"text":"宝探し？","source_cn":"寻宝？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D336513CF562AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1029506009":{"text":"宝探し？","source_cn":"寻宝？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D336513CF562AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029506010:1":{"text":"その伝説は確かに聞いたことがあるけど、月の神はとっくにいなくなったんじゃ……？","source_cn":"月神不是早早地陨落了吗？虽然我确实有听说过这个传说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A6A4F6F5A4AAAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029506011:1":{"text":"小さい頃、月の神殿で遊んだときに友だちから聞いたわ。彼らはもうここにいないけど……","source_cn":"小时候去月神遗殿玩耍的时候，有小伙伴提过，可惜他们也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224A712A85ED517E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029506012:2":{"text":"他に誰かこのことについて聞ける者はいるか？","source_cn":"请问，还有别的人可以打听这件事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4978E6160295B269","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029506013:1":{"text":"子どもの頃お父さんに聞いたことがあるわ。確か何か言ってたような……","source_cn":"我小时候曾经问过我的父亲，他有提到过什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9CDC68E6C5A3CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029506014:1":{"text":"だったら、あなたのお父さんに会わせてくれない？","source_cn":"请问，你可以带我们去找你的父亲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD2A987C14537CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029506015:1":{"text":"え……それは……","source_cn":"啊……这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944556FC9EB2D8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029506016:1":{"text":"すまない、彼女はやや勢い任せなところがあってな……困らせたいわけではないのだ。","source_cn":"对不起这位女士，我们的同伴性格有些莽撞，并不是要冒犯您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC89D4F7D20284706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","documen